flowchart LR
    P[Production interaction] --> F[Feedback + trace capture]
    F --> C[Teacher-LLM critique]
    C --> A[Candidate adaptation artifact]
    A --> S[Sanitization + policy checks]
    S --> R[Frozen regression + safety suite]
    R --> V[Versioned canary]
    V --> D[Production]
    F --> Q[Failure slice / correction queue]
    Q --> S
    R --> V
